 "remarks": "Welcome to 46 Fifth Street! This beautifully renovated first-floor unit offers the perfect blend of modern luxury, comfort, and coastal living in Norwalk's desirable Marvin Beach neighborhood. Thoughtfully updated throughout, the home features brand-new flooring, fresh paint, and a stunning kitchen complete with new cabinetry, quartz countertops, and stainless steel appliances. The beautifully updated bathroom offers heated floors and a double vanity for an added touch of luxury. Enjoy the warmth and ambiance of an electric fireplace, along with the everyday convenience of in-unit laundry and additional basement storage. Best of all, enjoy coveted Marvin Beach rights, offering access to the neighborhood's coastal amenities. With high-end finishes, modern conveniences, and an exceptional location, this move-in-ready home is a rare rental opportunity. Don't miss your chance to call it home!",
